              "printed_page": 149,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Avoid drugs likely to impair impulse conduction further (calcium channel blocking agents,β-adrenergic antagonists,α2-adrenergic agonists, amiodarone, propafenone).",
